            "failure_scenario": "If emit_results_output regressed to dropping `outputs` again, a pull_request whose CPU mutants section defers N>0 cfg(feature=cuda) survivors and whose mutants-cuda shard is skipped or red would leave the gate green; row 14 and the fat_driver self-test row now turn that RED."
          }
